flowchart LR
  untrusted[Untrusted payload/email/file] --> gateway[Ingress validation]
  gateway --> domain[Canonical domain model]
  domain --> policy[Policy boundary]
  policy --> investigation[Read-only investigation workers]
  policy --> approval[Human approval boundary]
  approval --> response[Response workers]
  response --> target[External target systems]
  domain --> evidence[Restricted evidence store]
  investigation -. no direct destructive access .-> target
  untrusted -. no direct control-plane access .-> domain
